WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.839 --> 00:00:10.989
The Reports page answers the questions your principal or your district are most likely to ask. How many seats are in use, who has joined, and what has been happening in the account.

2
00:00:11.489 --> 00:00:17.339
There are four tabs: Utilization, Teachers, Invitations, and Activity Log.

3
00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:29.180
Utilization shows how much of your license is in use. The circle shows the percentage, and beside it you'll see how many seats are assigned, how many are available, and how many were revoked.

4
00:00:29.681 --> 00:00:39.361
The Teachers tab lists each teacher with a seat. Select Export C-S-V to download the list as a spreadsheet you can open in Excel or Google Sheets.

5
00:00:39.863 --> 00:00:49.753
The Invitations tab lists every invitation, including teachers who started to register using a school email on their own. You can export this one too.

6
00:00:50.255 --> 00:01:00.985
The Activity Log is the record of what has happened in your account: invitations sent, seats changed, and so on. It's handy when you want to know who made a change, and when.

7
00:01:01.486 --> 00:01:07.156
It shows fifty entries at a time, so use the page buttons at the bottom to go back further.

8
00:01:07.664 --> 00:01:15.104
The activity log and the utilization tab don't have export buttons. If you need a copy, a screenshot works well.
